        "Content": "BEAUTIFULLY PRESENTED TWO-BEDROOM, TWO-BATHROOM APARTMENT\r\n\r\nLOCATED ON THE SECOND FLOOR\r\n\r\nSTYLISH KITCHEN WITH QUARTZ WORKTOPS AND INTEGRATED APPLIANCES\r\n\r\nQUIET RESIDENTIAL SETTING WITHIN MATURE LANDSCAPED GROUNDS\r\n\r\nRESIDENTS PARKING\r\n\r\nGAS FIRED CENTRAL HEATING\r\n\r\nEXCELLENT TRANSPORT LINKS WITH EASY ACCESS TO DUBLIN CITY CENTRE\r\n\r\nBRIGHT DUAL ASPECT ACCOMMODATION WITH EXCELLENT NATURAL LIGHT"
